 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Weddings run rough on nervous doubters like you. Try to just watch the bride smile. Good. Now, what's been wearing on your mind lately? Like what? Rain? A sudden family dispute? Or a last minute breaking up? Okay, then. What's the worst that could happen? The bride and groom split before sunrise? Then everyone goes home happy. Then entrust it to her quietly. Your nerves won't have time to get out of control if you do.",
